================================================================================
NOT AN OFFICIAL WARNING SERVICE
================================================================================

This software produces decision support, not authoritative warnings.

Nepal's official flood warnings are issued by the Department of Hydrology and
Meteorology (DHM) and the Ministry of Home Affairs (MoHA). Where this software
disagrees with them, they are correct.

Emergency numbers in Nepal:
    100     Nepal Police
    102     Ambulance
    1115    Health helpline (HEOC)
    1149    National Emergency Operation Centre
    1234    District Emergency Operation Centre

The forecast in this software performs at approximately parity with a naive
persistence baseline and is not validated against labelled flood outcomes. Its
measured skill, uncertainty calibration and known error sources are published in
docs/ANALYTICS.md. Anyone deploying this operationally should read that document
first and re-measure against their own data.

