================================================================================
DELIBERATE OMISSIONS
================================================================================

Facebook, Google Maps and Waze content is linked, not retrieved. Reading it
programmatically would require access this project does not have and would
breach those services' terms.

Bank account numbers and donation QR codes are deliberately NOT reproduced. The
Office of the Prime Minister has warned that unofficial QR codes and personal
accounts circulate after disasters; this software links to the government's own
payment pages instead.
